        Note: The first entry of the vals array MUST be Mass. Any other
        values will be ignored, including the weight array.
        ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
        Prints out information about all the nodes in the octree.

        Parameters
        ----------
        None.

        Examples
        --------
        >>> octree.print_all_nodes()
        (many lines of data)
